# Chest X-Ray Classification

ConvNeXt-V2-Tiny classifies pediatric radiographs as bacterial pneumonia, normal or viral pneumonia. [Explore the classification errors](https://kiselyovd.github.io/chest-xray-classifier/showcase/).

